OL,3,GNEWSAMidges' role in spreading disease
OL,4,Ato be investigated
OL,5,
OL,6,FThey can ruin a Scottish summer holiday
OL,7,Fwith their irritating bites.
OL,9,FNow researchers at the University of
OL,10,FGlasgow are set to investigate the more
OL,11,Fserious health risks posed by midges
OL,12,Fand mosquitoes.
OL,14,FThe team has secured funding to study
OL,15,Femerging diseases spread by the insects
OL,16,Facross the UK and help improve
OL,17,Fpreparedness for future outbreaks.
OL,19,FRecent cases of the bluetongue virus,
OL,20,Fwhich has devastated livestock across
OL,21,Fthe UK, are believed to have been
OL,22,Fspread via midges.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
